      <file>src/client/pcf/CommunicationTimeline/CommunicationTimeline/authInit.ts + hostContext.ts (REUSE — @spaarke/auth boundary + host record context)</file>
      <file>src/client/pcf/CommunicationTimeline/CommunicationTimeline/CommunicationTimelineApp.tsx + CommunicationTimelineHost.tsx (READ/MIRROR — mount the shared component with props)</file>
      <file>src/client/pcf/CommunicationTimeline/Solution/ (READ/MIRROR — solution project + ZIP layout)</file>
