    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-04">A form-bound PCF variant mirrors the R1 Timeline PCF + a regarding-resolution path; resolves the host record's `(entityType, id)`; renders FR-03 (grouped regarding view); declares a bound `anchorField`. Scope: build + pack the variant; form placement on all 11 is task 022.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">PCF uses React 16/17 PLATFORM libraries (mirror R1: React 16.14.0, Fluent 9.46.2) — MUST NOT bundle React 18; the mounted tree is 16/17-compatible.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-006">PCF is for form binding — the control binds the host record via `anchorField` (primary Name) and resolves `(entityType, id)` from context.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-026">Path-A exception — OOB form + PCF, NOT a Code Page. Cite in the PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">`@spaarke/auth` is consumed at the PCF boundary only (reuse R1 `authInit.ts`); the shared component never imports it.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-04">The packaged bundle MUST NOT contain any `@azure/communication-*` dependency; grep/inspect the bundle.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">MUST declare a bound `anchorField` property (primary Name) — a code component without a bound field/dataset is hidden from the form component library (R1 lesson; cite the R1 manifest note). Scope: this variant's manifest.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Build with `npm run build:prod` (NOT `npm run build` — AP-1 / root §12). Pack the solution ZIP; `pac import` is DEFERRED to the owner / task 022 (document the split).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Reuse the R1 `CommunicationTimeline` PCF packaging + auth boundary; do not invent a new pattern (§11). No BFF publish-size / CVE obligation — client + pack only (root §10 N/A).</constraint>
  </constraints>

