    <patterns>
      <pattern name="R1 Timeline PCF mirror" location="src/client/pcf/CommunicationTimeline/CommunicationTimeline/">
        Mirror `index.ts` (init/updateView/destroy), `authInit.ts` (@spaarke/auth boundary building `authenticatedFetch`), `hostContext.ts` (host record context), and the App/Host mount. Add only the regarding-resolution path + `mode='regarding'` mount.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Bound anchorField (R1 lesson)" location="src/client/pcf/CommunicationTimeline/CommunicationTimeline/ControlManifest.Input.xml">
        Declare `&lt;property name="anchorField" ... of-type="SingleLine.Text" usage="bound" required="true" /&gt;` bound to the primary Name; read `(entityType, id)` from context. Without a bound field/dataset the control is hidden from the form component library.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="ADR-022 platform libraries" location=".claude/adr/ADR-022-pcf-platform-libraries.md">
        Declare React/Fluent as platform libraries (React 16.14.0, Fluent 9.46.2 per R1); do not bundle React 18. The mounted tree must be 16/17-compatible.
      </pattern>
