  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Read the R1 `CommunicationTimeline` PCF (`ControlManifest.Input.xml`, `index.ts`, `authInit.ts`, `hostContext.ts`, App/Host, `Solution/`), `src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md`, `PCF-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md`, and ADR-022/ADR-006. Confirm the task-020 regarding-mode props contract `(mode, entityType, id, authenticatedFetch, bffBaseUrl)`.</step>
    <step order="2">Decide + document (notes): regarding-mode as a mode switch on the existing control vs a distinct variant control. Scaffold accordingly, mirroring R1's manifest — declare the bound `anchorField` (primary Name), platform libraries (React 16.14.0, Fluent 9.46.2), and the same feature-usage (WebAPI/Utility/Navigation) + input props (apiBaseUrl/tenantId/clientAppId/bffAppId).</step>
    <step order="3">Implement the regarding-resolution path in `index.ts`/host: resolve the host record's `(entityType, id)` from PCF page context (entity logical name + record id), build `authenticatedFetch` via the R1 `authInit.ts` boundary, read `bffBaseUrl`/config, and mount `&lt;CommunicationTimeline mode="regarding" entityType id authenticatedFetch bffBaseUrl /&gt;` via the platform React.</step>
    <step order="4">Verify React 16/17 compatibility of the mounted tree: run the PCF build; if a React-18-only API from 020 breaks under platform React, coordinate a shared-lib fix (do NOT fork). Grep the produced bundle for `@azure/communication` — MUST be absent (NFR-04) — and for `@spaarke/auth` inside the shared-component chunk — MUST be absent (only the PCF boundary imports it).</step>
    <step order="5">Run `npm run build:prod` in the control folder (NOT `npm run build` — AP-1). Resolve any manifest/type errors.</step>
    <step order="6">Pack the solution ZIP (mirror the R1 `Solution/` layout). Do NOT run `pac import` — record that the 11-form placement/import is deferred to task 022 / the owner. Validate the ZIP is well-formed.</step>
    <step order="7">Run UI tests via the `ui-test` skill against the built control (harness or a representative form if available): renders the regarding-mode grouped view without console errors; dark-mode correct; shows the record's threads-as-groups. (Full 11-form smoke is task 022.)</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: `code-review` on the PCF variant + manifest (focus: bound `anchorField` declared, platform libraries declared / no React 18 bundled, no ACS SDK in the bundle, `@spaarke/auth` at the boundary only, regarding-resolution reads context correctly); `adr-check` against ADR-022/ADR-006/ADR-026/ADR-028 + `spec.md` (FR-04, NFR-04). Address Critical + High findings.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (021 ✅) + `current-task.md`; record decisions (variant-vs-mode-switch choice, `(entityType, id)` resolution path, `anchorField` binding, platform-library versions, bundle grep evidence, UI-test evidence, the packaging-vs-import split handed to 022/owner).</step>
  </steps>

